<Base title="About | Taleeb Midi">
  <article class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Taleeb Midi, a Director of DevOps based in Massachusetts. I lead platform and
      infrastructure teams — building the CI/CD pipelines, observability, and automation
      that let engineers ship quickly without breaking things.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before management, I spent years as a Linux sysadmin and DevOps engineer, and I still
      like getting my hands dirty. This site is where I write about DevOps practices, Linux
      tooling, and lessons learned running production systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      Around here you'll find notes on things like HAProxy, rsyslog, Logstash, Ansible, and
      journalctl — the unglamorous infrastructure work that everything else depends on.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/tmidi">GitHub</a> · <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>